Russian translations of FreeBSD manual pages.

This package installs translated manual pages into man/ru/.
The translations are tracked per FreeBSD version via separate
flavors.  Choose the flavor matching your FreeBSD release:

  - main        for FreeBSD main (CURRENT)
  - releng_15_0 for FreeBSD 15.0
  - releng_15_1 for FreeBSD 15.1

WWW: https://github.com/freebsd-doc-ru/freebsd-man-ru
